  "contentHtml": "\n<p class=\"wp-block-paragraph\">Pinwheel sandwiches are easy, colorful appetizers made with tortillas, cream cheese, deli meat, and fresh vegetables rolled into perfect bite-sized spirals. Quick to prepare and endlessly customizable, they’re a favorite for parties, lunchboxes, or family picnics. Packed with flavor and ready in minutes, pinwheel sandwiches are a fun and delicious snack that disappears fast.</p>\n\n\n\n<div class=\"wp-block-rank-math-toc-block\" id=\"rank-math-toc\"><h2>Table of Contents</h2><nav><ul><li><a href=\"#why-youll-love-this-pinwheel-sandwiches\">Why You’ll Love This Pinwheel Sandwiches</a></li><li><a href=\"#ingredients\">Ingredients</a></li><li><a href=\"#how-to-make-pinwheel-sandwiches\">How to Make Pinwheel Sandwiches</a></li><li><a href=\"#recipe-snapshot\">Recipe Snapshot</a></li><li><a href=\"#pro-tips-for-making-pinwheel-sandwiches\">Pro Tips for Making Pinwheel Sandwiches</a></li><li><a href=\"#how-to-serve-this-pinwheel-sandwiches\">How to Serve this Pinwheel Sandwiches</a></li><li><a href=\"#make-ahead-and-storage\">Make Ahead and Storage</a></li><li><a href=\"#fa-qs\">FAQs</a></li><li><a href=\"#final-thoughts\">Final Thoughts</a></li></ul></nav></div>\n\n\n\n<h2 class=\"wp-block-heading\" id=\"why-youll-love-this-pinwheel-sandwiches\"><strong>Why You’ll Love This Pinwheel Sandwiches</strong></h2>\n\n\n\n<ul class=\"wp-block-list\">\n<li>They&#8217;re a fun, bite-sized treat perfect for any gathering.</li>\n\n\n\n<li>Endless filling options to suit every taste and dietary need.</li>\n\n\n\n<li>Quick and easy to prepare, making them a go-to snack.</li>\n\n\n\n<li>Visually appealing, adding a pop of color to your table.</li>\n\n\n\n<li>Great for meal prep; they stay fresh in the fridge!</li>\n</ul>\n\n\n<div id=\"wprm-recipe-container-3112\" class=\"wprm-recipe-container\" data-recipe-id=\"3112\" data-servings=\"8\"><div class=\"wprm-recipe wprm-recipe-template-meadow\"><div class=\"wprm-layout-container wprm-pa